{
  "slug": "doit-mcp-skills",
  "name": "Doit Mcp Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Repo not found",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `doit-mcp-anomaly-investigation` (Use this skill ALWAYS when the user asks about cost anomalies, spending spikes, unexpected charges, or suspicious costs), `doit-mcp-api` (Use this skill when the user asks to integrate with the DoiT API, generate API code, build programmatic…), `doit-mcp-reporting` (Use this skill ALWAYS when the user asks about cloud costs, spending, reports, services, invoices, or any DoiT…), `doit-mcp-setup` (Set up the DoiT MCP server in supported clients and verify the connection flow)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `doit-mcp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install doit-mcp-skills@claude-community` from `doitintl/doit-mcp-skills`.",
